        }
      ],
      "entryStepId": "talk",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "talk",
          "speakerRef": "@target",
          "text": "阿兰扶正一株歪倒的药草：「药圃挪到医舍边，照料是省脚力了，可扎架子的木头还得备着。帮我带八份粗木，我留三份药材给你。」\n\n「不必逞能赶工。药田、口粮和你自己的伤，都要顾。」\n\n接取后向本人交付，在任务日志领取回报。",
          "outcomes": [],
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "accept",
              "text": "这笔我愿意做。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [
                {
                  "kind": "acceptQuestFromTarget",
                  "id": "base:quest_340_herb_support"
                }
              ],
              "nextStepId": "",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "later",
              "text": "先留着，回头再说。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": "",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
